<title>SWITZERLAND: Third Swiss beet test shows weight, sugar up.</title>
<headline>Third Swiss beet test shows weight, sugar up.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's third sugar beet test showed a much bigger average beet weight than a year ago, and a higher sugar content, Zuckerfabrik + Raffinerie Aarberg AG said.</p>
<p>The test was carried out on August 27. Details follow:</p>
<p>				   Aug 27  Year-ago week   Aug 13</p>
<p> Beet weight, grammes	  898	  646	  765</p>
<p> Beet per hectare, tonnes    81.6	 59.5	 71.7</p>
<p> Leaf-root weight ratio	0.8	  0.7	  0.9</p>
<p> Sugar content, percent	15.1	 14.9	 14.0</p>
<p> Rain since April 1 (mm)     379.7	381.4	348.1</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
